{
  "key": "pr-1095",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "chore(factory): pin dmtools-agents @1aad43d0 — review-machine-unlinked (owner order 2026-09-30)",
    "description": "Bumps the three machine-loop stubs (machine-sm / ai-teammate / machine-merge) from 20c10eee (#572) to 1aad43d0 (#576) in dmtools-agents.\n\n**Why now** — owner order 2026-09-30: validated-but-never-reviewed starvation of machine-authored PRs with no OPEN linked issue. Live: #1068 sat `ai_validated` **19h** with zero review legs (#1071 / #1075 in the same state). dmtools-agents#576 adds the `review-machine-unlinked` rule (machine-author twin of `review-external-once`; `prMachineAuthor` fails closed; no checks requirement so silent-updated `none` heads are covered; structural dedup via the leg's own check run). After this pin lands, #1071/#1075 (and any future issue-less machine PR) get review legs automatically.\n\nAlso rides in: #573 (pack releases are self-contained snapshots), #574 (DMTOOLS_PACK_REGISTRY in the agent run env).\n\n`factory_stub_ref_test.dart` green — all three stubs flip in lockstep (uses-ref + factory_ref echo)."
  }
}

